","key":"stæhrsanjinaupadhyaypau","last":"Stæhr","name":"Stæhr, Sanjina Upadhyay","rank":29,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Sidsel Gurholt","key":"pedersensidselgurholtpau","last":"Pedersen","name":"Pedersen, Sidsel Gurholt","rank":30,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Sidsel Juul","key":"vinbæksidseljuulpau","last":"Vinbæk","name":"Vinbæk, Sidsel Juul","rank":31,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Steen","key":"gyldenkærnesteenpau","last":"Gyldenkærne","name":"Gyldenkærne, Steen","rank":32,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Stig","key":"andersensørenstigpau","last":"Andersen","name":"Andersen, Søren Stig","rank":33,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Teis","key":"boderskovteispau","last":"Boderskov","name":"Boderskov, Teis","rank":34,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Thor S.","key":"jørgensenthorspau","last":"Jørgensen","name":"Jørgensen, Thor S.","rank":35,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Timi L.","key":"banketimilpau","last":"Banke","name":"Banke, Timi L.","rank":36,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Trine A.","key":"andersentrineapau","last":"Andersen","name":"Andersen, Trine A.","rank":37,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Trine C.","key":"larsentrinecpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Trine C.","rank":38,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.11581/9a2a9533-0988-4115-b548-79170e0337e4","isbn":["9788774814276"],"issn":["13958216"],"issue":"484-2025","pages":"100","place":"Kgs. Lyngby","publisher":"DTU Aqua","repno":"DTU Aqua-rapport, 484-2025","series":"DTU Aqua-rapport","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","sdg":["14. Life Below Water","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All GTS Institutes","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-GTS-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","GTS Institutes","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-9a2a9533-0988-4115-b548-79170e0337e4"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Ålegræstransplantering og tangdyrkning som marine virkemidler: Potentialer, effekter og juridiske aspekter : Synteserapport for projektet ”Udviklingsinitiativer for Marine Virkemidler”","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-827804","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"abstract":"Aims: Diabetes in patients with chronic pancreatitis is a heterogeneous condition with some patients presenting with pre-existing diabetes and others developing diabetes after pancreatitis onset. We aimed to characterise beta and alpha cell function in these patients and examine differences between those with and without pre-existing diabetes. Methods: We included 26 patients with chronic pancreatitis and insulin-treated diabetes, divided into two subgroups: 13 with pre-pancreatitis diabetes (having type 2 diabetes before their chronic pancreatitis diagnosis) and 13 with post-pancreatitis diabetes. Patients underwent comprehensive clinical characterisation, including an arginine stimulation test to measure fasting and stimulated levels of C-peptide and glucagon. Additionally, they were monitored with continuous glucose monitoring over 20 days. Results: Patients with chronic pancreatitis and diabetes exhibited reduced fasting and stimulated C-peptide and glucagon responses to arginine, though responses varied considerably among individuals. Post-pancreatitis diabetes patients had lower glucagon responses than those with pre-pancreatitis diabetes (mean difference −19.3 pmol/L, 95% confidence interval (CI) −35.6 to −3.0). However, C-peptide levels were similar between the groups. Pre-pancreatitis diabetes patients spent more time in level 2 hyperglycaemia compared to post-pancreatitis patients (12.9% vs. 6.7%, p = 0.02). In contrast, post-pancreatitis diabetes patients had more time in both level 1 and level 2 hypoglycaemia (p = 0.03 and p = 0.05, respectively). A low glucagon response was correlated with time spent in hypoglycaemia (Rho = −0.54, p < 0.01). Conclusions: Diabetes in chronic pancreatitis is a heterogeneous entity. The presence of type 2 diabetes prior to chronic pancreatitis is associated with a reduced risk of alpha cell dysfunction and hypoglycaemia.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Davidsen, Line","Lebech Cichosz, Simon","Knoph, Cecilie Siggaard","Larsen, Isabelle Myriam","Stæhr, Peter Bisgaard","Vestergaard, Peter","Jensen, Morten Hasselstrøm","Hartmann, Bolette","Holst, Jens Juul","Drewes, Asbjørn Mohr","Juel, Caroline Trunk Black","Knop, Filip K.","Olesen, Søren Schou"],"cuid":["S02-086.42-822426"],"filters":{"added":"2025-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Olesen, Søren Schou"],"keyword":["C Peptide","Chronic pancreatitis","Diabetes","Glucagon","Hypoglycaemia"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-NDR"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-NOVO"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-NDR","DI-PR-NOVO","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"unravelling the heterogeneity of diabetes in chronic pancreatitis alpha and beta cell dysfunction and association with glycaemic control","src":["aau","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/dme.70080","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["Supported by Steno Diabetes Centre North Denmark, A.P. M\\u00F8ller and Chastine Mc\\u2010Kinney M\\u00F8ller's Foundation, Heinrich Kopp's Grant, Region North Denmark Health Science Research Foundation, and Dexcom, Inc."],"id":"S02-086.42-822426","identifier":[{"id":"105007243836","type":"scopus"},{"id":"40449988","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC12257435","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["aau-ab8a99d6-1900-463a-8b62-14676ea9b766","ku-992bc1a9-42db-46f7-abf1-dab3d15315b7"],"keyword":["C-peptide","chronic pancreatitis","diabetes","glucagon","hypoglycaemia"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-A20C5E9D6C4881C76E61FE77A59C18A2"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/457580845/Unravelling_the_heterogeneity.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/dme.70080","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Department of Gastroenterology and Hepatology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"north denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-NDR","l3nl":"North Denmark Region","l3nn":"North Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"North Denmark Region","namevar":["Aalborg University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-NDR","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"novo nordisk","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-NOVO","l3nl":"Novo Nordisk","l3nn":"Novo Nordisk","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Novo Nordisk","namevar":["Novo Nordisk A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-NOVO","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Biomedical Sciences, Endocrinology and Metabolism"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capi