{"abstract":"Det er forskningen, der ligger til grund for alle andre aktiviteter på museerne. Derfor bør den ikke som nu på forhånd devalueres eller sløres ved et mere favnende begreb om vidensudveksling, mener Dansk Center for Museumsforskning, der mener, at forskning skal være et uomgængeligt krav til statsanerkendte museer med en ny reform","author_count":9,"contributors":["Christensen, Hans Dam","Handberg, Kristian","Jensen, Jens F.","Knudsen, Line Vestergaard","Hejlskov Larsen, Ane","Mortensen, Christian Hviid","Sørensen, Anne Scott","Vestergaard, Vitus","Falch Yates, Mia"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-719434"],"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"forskningsbegrebet står alt for svagt i reformrapport","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://kulturmonitor.dk/debat/art9711337/Forskningsbegrebet-st%C3%A5r-alt-for-svagt-i-reformrapport","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-719434","ids":["ku-1a00bbc2-1034-419d-8e9b-5b0f451841a3"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-91851D66DD21E88A1CF87FB6EAEB0A60"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://kulturmonitor.dk/debat/art9711337/Forskningsbegrebet-st%C3%A5r-alt-for-svagt-i-reformrapport","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Humanities, Department