e","key":"weisspau","last":"Weiss","name":"Weiss, Eva Christine","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"12","first":"Isolde","key":"stroblpau","last":"Strobl","name":"Strobl, Isolde","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6 7","first":"Lone","key":"laursenpau","last":"Laursen","name":"Laursen, Lone","rank":17,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"7","first":"Jeanette Tranberg","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Jeanette Tranberg","rank":18,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"13","first":"Kristin","key":"skogstrandpau","last":"Skogstrand","name":"Skogstrand, Kristin","rank":19,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"14","first":"Elisabeth","key":"kramplbettelheimpau","last":"Krampl-Bettelheim","name":"Krampl-Bettelheim, Elisabeth","rank":21,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Ann","key":"taborpau","last":"Tabor","name":"Tabor, Ann","rank":22,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["38964134"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.jri.2024.104286","issn":["01650378","18727603"],"issn_org":["01650378"],"journal":"Journal of Reproductive Immunology","paperid":"104286","publisher":"Elsevier Ireland Ltd","status":"p","title":"Journal of Reproductive Immunology","volume":"164"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85197211697"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Governmental Institutions","Hospitals","North Denmark Region","Region Zealand","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-8e845d36-d7b1-4096-910b-94558af3d0a4","au-8684deb7-7f64-4149-be8a-e9c86f09d07b","ku-de8add85-a799-455e-9a38-33332bca00cc","sdu-ede1fb5a-daee-43be-a505-88f16d56d22e"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Inflammatory markers in relation to maternal lifestyle and adverse pregnancy outcomes in twin pregnancies","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S04-093.15-751602","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Objectives: This study aimed to compare antibody trajectories among individuals with SARS-CoV-2 hybrid and vaccine-induced immunity. Methods: Danish adults receiving three doses of BTN162b2 or mRNA-1237 were included prior to first vaccination (Day 0). SARS-CoV-2 anti-spike IgG levels were assessed before each vaccine dose, at Day 90, Day 180, 28 days after 3rd vaccination (Day 251), Day 365, and prior to 4th vaccination (Day 535). SARS-CoV-2 PCR results were extracted from the national microbiology database. Mixed-effect multivariable linear regression investigated the impact of hybrid-immunity (stratified into 4 groups: no hybrid immunity, PCR+ prior to 3rd dose, PCR+ after 3rd dose and before Day 365, PCR+ after Day 365) on anti-spike IgG trajectories. Results: A total of 4,936 individuals were included, 47% developed hybrid-immunity. Anti-spike IgG increases were observed in all groups at Day 251, with the highest levels in those PCR+ prior to 3rd dose (Geometric Mean; 535,647AU/mL vs. 374,665AU/mL with no hybrid-immunity, P<0.0001). Further increases were observed in participants who developed hybrid immunity after their 3rd dose. Anti-spike IgG levels declined from Day 251-535 in individuals without hybrid-immunity and in those who developed hybrid-immunity prior to their 3rd dose, with lower rate of decline in those with hybrid-immunity. Conclusion: Hybrid-immunity results in higher and more durable antibody trajectories in vaccinated individuals.","author_count":27,"contributors":["Reekie, Joanne","Stovring, Henrik","Nielsen, Henrik","Johansen, Isik S.","Benfield, Thomas","Wiese, Lothar","Stærke, Nina Breinholt","Iversen, Kasper","Mustafa, Ahmed Basim","Petersen, Kristine Toft","Juhl, Maria Ruwald","Knudsen, Lene Surland","Iversen, Mette Brouw","Andersen, Sidsel Dahl","Larsen, Fredrikke Dam","Baerends, Eva Anna Marianne","Lindvig, Susan Olaf","Rasmussen, Line Dahlerup","Madsen, Lone Wulff","Bannister, Wendy","Jensen, Tomas Oestergaard","Dietz, Lisa Loksø","Ostrowski, Sisse Rye","Østergaard, Lars","Tolstrup, Martin","Lundgren, Jens","Søgaard, Ole Schmeltz"],"cuid":["S04-095.89-741595"],"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":4,"corpau":["ENFORCE Study Group"],"corresponding_author":["Reekie, Joanne"],"keyword":["Anti spike IgG","Hybrid immunity","SARS CoV 2","Vaccines"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"development of antibody levels and subsequent decline in individuals with vaccine induced and hybrid immunity to sars cov 000000000002","src":["aau","au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijid.2024.107111","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["This study was funded by a grant from the Danish Ministry of Health (act 150, 28 th January 2021)."],"id":"S04-095.89-741595","identifier":[{"id":"001348298800001","type":"wos"},{"id":"38801970","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85196316682","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-ebb35e57-082c-48bf-a97d-04202c86af1f","au-3c5c57c1-7a5f-45db-be00-cb9344b49615","ku-17a3fa9e-b2a8-416f-a762-fa10ee30e24c","sdu-8dd92032-b7a8-4e7b-b8ab-5ffe6e27950d"],"keyword":["Anti-spike IgG","Hybrid immunity","SARS-CoV-2","Vaccines"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-7-826F6974FF019C401076748B29BF0276"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/7413523