:"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"The article is a qualitative single case study which consists of text coherence analyses of two student texts written by a 4th grade student, Oscar, before and after a researcher-generated intervention in the subject Danish focusing on text coherence. The study adheres to text-oriented writing research, but also includes a social-contextual framework (Schultz & Fecho, 2000) by elucidating the text analyses with analyses of the two specific teaching contexts in which Oscar wrote his texts. The text analyses contribute to a detailed understanding of how Oscar creates text coherence, as well as how coherence can be examined at this grade. The study’s inclusion of context analyses provides nuances for the text analyses and emphasizes that an understanding of the interaction between text and empirical writing context is crucial for understanding Oscar’s writing. The text coherence is examined through an analysis of semantic chains, grounded in a functional linguistics inspired by Hasan (1984, 1989), but also by Enkvist (1974), Källgren (1979) and Nyström (2001), while the contextual data (field notes, photos, writing frames and two interviews with Oscar about his texts) are analyzed through an interpretive analysis of selected key incidents (Erickson, 1977, 1986). The text analyses show that the post-text is somewhat less coherent than the pre-text, while the context analyses find that the weakening of coherence in Oscar’s post-text probably can be attributed to the text’s specific teaching context, especially the teacher’s task instructions. The study’s findings, including its didactic implications, are discussed at the end of the article.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Larsen, Line Kjærgaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-795806"],"filters":{"added":"2025-04","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Writing","Writing instruction"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"tekstkohærens i faget dansk på mellemtrinnet et kvalitativt studie af én elevs tekster belyst gennem teksternes empiriske skrivekontekster","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.5617/adno.10744","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-795806","identifier":[{"id":"85212870208","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-24d526e6-1844-4422-aaa2-4a3349bc6fe1"],"keyword":["4 grade","text coherence","writing","writing context","writing instruction"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-51AE8F6669C8537FFA6F74527706D331"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.5617/adno.10744","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, Danish School of Education, Danish School of Education - Educational Theory and Curriculum Studies, Emdrup"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Line Kjærgaard","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"18c1c950-d5e2-437f-83db-ccc6779f4717","name":"Larsen, Line Kjærgaard","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.5617/adno.10744","issn":["15049922"],"issue":"3","journal":"Acta Didactica Norden","paperid":"7","publisher":"Universitetet i Oslo","status":"p","title":"Acta Didactica Norden","volume":"18"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85212870208"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-24d526e6-1844-4422-aaa2-4a3349bc6fe1"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Tekstkohærens i faget dansk på mellemtrinnet : Et kvalitativt studie af én elevs tekster belyst gennem teksternes empiriske skrivekontekster","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-795806","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
