"name":"Nielsen, Xiaohui C.","rank":83,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian H.","key":"schouwchristianhoth","last":"Schouw","name":"Schouw, Christian H.","rank":84,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"jensenandersoth","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Anders","rank":85,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Ea S.","key":"marmolineasoth","last":"Marmolin","name":"Marmolin, Ea S.","rank":86,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"John E.","key":"coiajohneoth","last":"Coia","name":"Coia, John E.","rank":87,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Dorte T.","key":"andersendortetoth","last":"Andersen","name":"Andersen, Dorte T.","rank":88,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mads","key":"albertsenmadspau","last":"Albertsen","locid":"6c728ec9-5a0d-40c7-b3f3-1741c6e01ccc","name":"Albertsen, Mads","orcid":"0000-0002-6151-190X","rank":89,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["35505393"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1186/s13073-022-01045-7","issn":["1756994X"],"issue":"1","journal":"Genome Medicine","paperid":"47","publisher":"BioMed Central Ltd.","status":"p","title":"Genome Medicine","volume":"14"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85129997318"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Governmental Institutions","Hospitals","North Denmark Region","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-e1d96822-d59b-45a3-b51f-6e36f19b02d1","dtu-d4ee83d3-1835-45e8-ad47-e535115bd0ce","ku-51b0d01b-2672-480d-b31c-e83ffa63c4d4","sdu-43413a40-3fef-478a-bbab-354d2e418a06"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Introduction and transmission of SARS-CoV-2 lineage B.1.1.7, Alpha variant, in Denmark","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S04-093.49-010787","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"Background: Socioeconomic differences in survival among children with acute lymphoblastic leukemia (ALL) have been reported in high-income countries and there is an unmet need for strategies to identify vulnerable patient subgroups. Reported differences in survival for children from families with different socioeconomic positions seem to arise when starting maintenance therapy. This could reflect reduced physician's compliance or family adherence to maintenance therapy. Methods: This nationwide cohort study with extensive monitoring of systemic methotrexate (MTX)/6-mercaptopurine (6MP) dosing and metabolite levels, retrospectively investigated 173 Danish children treated according to The Nordic Society for Pediatric Hematology and Oncology ALL2008 protocol from 2008 to 2016. Results: Significantly lower prescribed doses of MTX and 6MP were seen in the children in families with short parental education (short vs. medium vs. higher education: mMTX: 13.8, 16.2, and 18.6 mg/m 2/week; p <.01; m6MP: 47.4, 64.9, and 66.1 mg/m 2/day; p =.03) or parents unemployed/not in workforce (unemployed/not in workforce vs. mixed vs. at work: mMTX: 15.0, 19.9, and 17.2 mg/m 2/week; p <.01; m6MP: 54.8, 72.0, and 65.1 mg/m 2/day; p <.01). When assessing family adherence by analyzing MTX and 6MP metabolite levels, including per prescribed dose of MTX and 6MP, we found no significant differences by levels of parental education, affiliation to work market, or income (p >.05 for all comparisons). Conclusions: These results indicate that inferior physician compliance to protocol recommendations on drug dosage rather than families’ adherence to therapy may contribute to the association between socioeconomic position and cure rates in childhood ALL, although precise mechanisms remain to be explored.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Pedersen, Line Hjøllund","Østergaard, Anna","Bank, Victoria","Nersting, Jacob","Tuckuviene, Ruta","Wehner, Peder Skov","Albertsen, Birgitte Klug","Degn, Matilda","Als-Nielsen, Bodil Elise Thorhauge","Larsen, Hanne Baekgaard","Schmiegelow, Kjeld","Dalton, Susanne Oksbjerg"],"cuid":["S04-097.89-008738"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":4,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Pedersen, Line Hjøllund"],"country":["Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Princess Máxima Center for Pediatric Oncology","Utrecht University"],"keyword":["6 Mercaptopurine","Acute Disease","Adherence","Antineoplastic Combined Chemotherapy Protocols therapeutic use","Chemotherapy","Child","Childhood","Childhood leukemia","Cohort Studies","Compliance","Danish registers","Health","Humans","Maintenance therapy","Medication Adherence","Mercaptopurine","Methotrexate","Methotrexate therapeutic use","Precursor Cell Lymphoblastic Leukemia Lymphoma drug therapy","Relapse","Retrospective Studies","Socioeconomic Factors","Socioeconomic position","Survival"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-NP","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"NP":["DI-NP-ALL","DI-NP-CAN"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-NP-CAN","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"socioeconomic position and maintenance therapy in children with acute lymphoblastic leukemia a national cohort study","src":["aau","au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/197440304/pbc.29508.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S04-097.89-008738","identifier":[{"id":"85121484324","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000734129600001","type":"wos"},{"id":"34931732","type":"pmid"}],"ids":[