{"abstract":"Communication networks are not only important to society, they also consume a lot of energy. Recent years research has focused on Cloud-Radio Access Network (C-RAN) to decrease the energy consumption of mobile networks. Hence, this work investigates how to lower the energy consumption in the fronthaul network by choosing the right C-RAN functional split and the right type of fronthaul network. Different functional splits assign different loads to the fronthaul network, and this work considers how much impact the data load has on the fronthaul network’s energy consumption. At the same time different types of fronthaul network impact the energy consumption in different ways. The paper provides models to be used for calculating the energy consumption in different network types and for the choice of different functional splits. Results show huge differences in energy consumption between especially wired and wireless technologies. Considering the same functional split, the difference between the most energy consuming transport technology and the least energy consuming is 99.5% for LTE and 99.6% for 5G. For the Ethernet overlay alone, the difference in energy consumption between the, with regard to energy consumption, best and worst case scenario is 99.3% per switch.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Larsen, Line Maria Pyndt","Berger, Michael Stübert","Christiansen, Henrik Lehrmann"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-369778"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["5G","C RAN","Energy consumption","Ethernet","Fronthaul","Functional split","Green networking","PON","PTP"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"energy aware technology comparisons for 000000000005g mobile fronthaul networks","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/255196631/IARIA_journal_v5_camera_.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-369778","ids":["dtu-da111d33-9dd0-4d42-aa3b-2de64944e8b3"],"keyword":["5G","C-RAN","CWDM","Energy consumption","Ethernet","Fronthaul","Functional split","Green networking","PON","PtP"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-04F197C49DA3665398BB48FF0865C6B5"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/255196631/IARIA_journal_v5_camera_.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Photonics Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Photonics Engineering, Networks Technology and Service Platforms"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Line Maria Pyndt","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"e76034cd-61d0-43dd-8c6d-0aa95c672b80","name":"Larsen, Line Maria Pyndt","orcid":"0000-0002-6402-5851","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Michael Stübert","key":"bergerpau","last":"Berger","locid":"7b367889-bde0-4e40-893f-0a22e4d32371","name":"Berger, Michael Stübert","orcid":"0000-0003-4575-7261","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik Lehrmann","key":"christiansenpau","last":"Christiansen","locid":"f3aec174-d663-4d97-aaa0-81cd6f4493a9","name":"Christiansen, Henrik Lehrmann","orcid":"0000-0002-9558-3493","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["19422644"],"issue":"1&2","journal":"International Journal On Advances in Networks and Services","pages":"21-32","publisher":"IARIA","status":"p","title":"International Journal On Advances in Networks and Services","volume":"13"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","sdg":["7. Affordable and Clean Energy","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-da111d33-9dd0-4d42-aa3b-2de64944e8b3"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Energy-Aware Technology Comparisons for 5G Mobile Fronthaul Networks","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-369778","year":"2020","yearsub":"2021"}
