{"abstract":"Cloud-Radio Access Network (C-RAN) is seen as a promising mobile network architecture for both current and future Radio Access Technologies (RATs). However, commercial C-RAN deployments are not yet commonly seen and thus experience from operational networks is limited. This means that standard procedures and best practices for roll out are yet to be established. This work provides a case study, where a small but densely populated part of the network owned by the Danish mobile network operator, TDC, is evaluated for C-RAN deployment. A roadmap is provided which uses traffic data as input and the output is a sequence of when the specific cells should have C-RAN deployed. Any operator to create their own roadmap towards C-RAN deployment can use the methods derived for the roadmap in this work.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Larsen, Line Maria Pyndt","Ruepp, Sarah Renée","Christiansen, Henrik Lehrmann"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-358573"],"event":{"end":"2017-11-24","place":"London , gb","start":"2017-11-22","title":"8th International Conference on the Network of the Future","year":"2017"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["C RAN","Deployment","Network operator"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"real life c ran deployment considerations","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/NOF.2017.8251239","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-358573","identifier":[{"id":"85049631484","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-b4c39f7a-f772-465b-8b37-cd15bf74ee88"],"keyword":["C-RAN","Deployment","Inter-cell cooperation","Network operator","Shared processing"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-604481DFF5020C240E2243A7EE1AAEC4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/NOF.2017.8251239","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/142515711/PID5058821.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Photonics Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Photonics Engineering, Networks Technology and Service Platforms"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Line Maria Pyndt","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"e76034cd-61d0-43dd-8c6d-0aa95c672b80","name":"Larsen, Line Maria Pyndt","name_org":"Hansen, Line Maria Pyndt","orcid":"0000-0002-6402-5851","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sarah Renée","key":"ruepppau","last":"Ruepp","locid":"92dfeab4-28ff-437d-9f5d-e7d8d6a67b93","name":"Ruepp, Sarah Renée","orcid":"0000-0003-0205-5067","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik Lehrmann","key":"christiansenpau","last":"Christiansen","locid":"f3aec174-d663-4d97-aaa0-81cd6f4493a9","name":"Christiansen, Henrik Lehrmann","orcid":"0000-0002-9558-3493","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/nof.2017.8251239","pages":"147-149","publisher":"IEEE","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 8th International Conference on the Network of the Future (NOF)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85049631484"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-b4c39f7a-f772-465b-8b37-cd15bf74ee88"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Real-life C-RAN deployment considerations","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-358573","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"PURPOSE: We examined the effect of preconception paternal use of azathioprine (AZA)/6-mercaptopurine (6-MP) or methotrexate (MTX) and the risk of adverse long-term outcomes in the offspring. METHODS: This study included all children born in Denmark from 1 January 1997 through 2013. Exposed cohort: children fathered by men who used AZA/6-MP (N=735) or MTX (N=209) within three months before conception; unexposed cohort: children fathered by men who did not use AZA/6-MP/MTX (N=1,056,524). OUTCOMES: malignancies, autism spectrum disorders (ASD)/schizophrenia/psychosis, and attention deficit hyperactivity disorder (ADHD). RESULTS: Outcomes: of children: AZA/6-MP exposure: one with leukemia (0.14%), one with ASD/schizophrenia (0.14%) and three with ADHD (0.41%); MTX exposure: three with ADHD (1.4%). Unexposed: 1710 with malignancies (0.16%), 2107 with ASD/schizophrenia (0.20%), 2799 with ADHD (0.26%). Median follow up times were 6.7 [IQR:3.6-11.3] and 9.9 [IQR:5.7-14.3] years respectively. CONCLUSIONS: There was no negative impact of paternal preconception use of AZA/6-MP/MTX on selected childhood health outcomes.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Friedman, Sonia","Larsen, Michael Due","Magnussen, Bjarne","Jølving, Line Riis","de Silva, P","Nørgård, Bente Mertz"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-614506"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Brigham and Women's Hospital","Harvard Medical School"],"keyword":["Journal Article"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"paternal use of azathioprine 000000000006 mercaptopurine or methotrexate within 000000000003 months before conception and long term health outcomes in the offspring a nationwide cohort study","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/135803574/Paternal_use_of_azathioprine_6_mercaptopurine_or_methotrexate_within_3_months_before_conception_and_long_term_health_outcomes_in_the_offspring_A_nationwide_co.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-614506","identifier":[{"id":"85028508302","type":"scopus"},{"id":"28844800","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["sdu-90194ccc-6880-4696-949c-9b0f191bf78f"],"keyword":["Journal Article"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-F5A94A26F43D53C8D48DC2DDB6BDAAE6"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/135803574/Paternal_use_of_azathioprine_6_mercaptopurine_or_methotrexate_within_3_months_before_conception_and_long_term_health_outcomes_in_the_offspring_A_nationwide_co.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Clinical Epidemiology (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"harvard medical school","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Harvard Medical School","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"brigham and women s hospital","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Brigham and Women's Hospital","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"S","key":"friedmanpau","last":"Friedman","locid":"90853ab4-d45c-494e-978e-466b9d70d775","name":"Friedman, Sonia","name_org":"Friedman, S","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"M D","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"3de91a40-2cd5-40f2-b680-9ef23b0778cf","name":"Larsen, Michael Due","name_org":"Larsen, M D","orcid":"0000-0002-0623-2481","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"B","key":"magnussenpau","last":"Magnussen","locid":"2d97f041-4682-4b29-881a-fe7adefeb899","name":"Magnussen, Bjarne","name_org":"Magnussen, B","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"L R","key":"jølvingpau","last":"Jølving","locid":"524924f0-2e37-4535-9dd3-59630ea8c815","name":"Jølving, Line Riis","name_org":"Jølving, L R","orcid":"0000-0002-7433-7656","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"P","key":"desilvapau","last":"de Silva","name":"de Silva, P","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"B M","key":"nørgårdpau","last":"Nørgård","locid":"3d41d6fb-8f1c-4899-9ebd-b72f88e3935d","name":"Nørgård, Bente Mertz","name_org":"Nørgård, B M","orcid":"0000-0002-9514-3033","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["28844800"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.reprotox.2017.08.013","issn":["08906238","18731708"],"issn_org":["08906238"],"journal":"Reproductive Toxicology","pages":"196-200","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Reproductive Toxicology","title_org":"Reproductive toxicology (Elmsford, N.Y.)","volume":"73"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85028508302"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-90194ccc-6880-4696-949c-9b0f191bf78f"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Paternal use of azathioprine/6-mercaptopurine or methotrexate within 3 months before conception and long-term health outcomes in the offspring : A nationwide cohort study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-614506","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"There is a growing interest in lignin valorization to biofuels and chemicals. Here, we propose a novel and simple noncatalytic process to directly liquefy lignin rich solid residual from second generation bioethanol production by solvolysis with ethanol. Through an extensive parameter study in batch autoclaves assessing the effects of varying reaction temperature, reaction time, and solvent:lignin ratio, it is shown that hydrothermally pretreated enzymatic hydrolysis lignin solvolysis in supercritical ethanol can produce a heptane soluble bio-oil without the need for exhaustive deoxygenation. The process does not require addition of catalyst or a reducing agent such as hydrogen. The process is advantageously carried out with a low reaction period ((<1 h) and with a reduced amount of solvent to lignin feedstock (ethanol:lignin (w/w) ratio of 2:1) which is a previously unexplored domain for lignin solvolysis. The resulting bio-oil product is mainly a mixture of di- and monomeric lignin species where the original lignin unit linkages have been broken. The oxygen content is lowered to <10 wt %(corresponding to an HHV of 36 MJ/kg) and the bio-oil is stable and acid free (verified by NMR), and due to the use of sulfur free lignin rich residual as feedstock, the resulting oil product is equally sulfur free. The residual solid product (char) has a reduced oxygen content relative to the lignin feed and equally increased higher heating value, making it a candidate for use as a biochar.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Nielsen, Joachim Bachmann","Jensen, Anders","Madsen, Line Riis","Larsen, Flemming H.","Felby, Claus","Jensen, Anker Degn"],"cuid":["S02-095.74-032756"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"noncatalytic direct liquefaction of biorefinery lignin by ethanol","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/145749437/ACS_Direct_Liquefaction_of_Biorefinery_Lignin.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S02-095.74-032756","identifier":[{"id":"85025176193","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000406356600060","type":"wos"}],"ids":["dtu-07c37c33-68c0-4a4b-ae55-9e6a1c080d09","ku-9e3ec9ce-2698-4667-bcb0-c68afc253f07"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-467AA215EC8354D8091BD5FC65DAA6A1"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/145749437/ACS_Direct_Liquefaction_of_Biorefinery_Lignin.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemical and Biochemical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemical and Biochemical Engineering, CHEC Research Centre"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Food Science, Food Analytics and Biotechnology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk