tatus":"p","title":"Proust og krigen. 1915-2015","volume":"10"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-a8446697-1a95-42b2-8496-3b465f9a0b47"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Proust og karikaturen","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-493956","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Purpose: To determine the genetic contribution to the pattern of retinal vascular branching expressed by its fractal dimension. Methods: This was a cross-sectional study of 50 monozygotic and 49 dizygotic, same-sex twin pairs aged 20 to 46 years. In 50°, disc-centered fundus photographs, the retinal vascular fractal dimension was measured using the box-counting method and compared within monozygotic and dizygotic twin pairs using Pearson correlation coefficients. Falconer's formula and quantitative genetic models were used to determine the genetic component of variation. Results: The mean fractal dimension did not differ statistically significantly between monozygotic and dizygotic twin pairs (1.505 vs. 1.495, P = 0.06), supporting that the study population was suitable for quantitative analysis of heritability. The intrapair correlation was markedly higher (0.505, P = 0.0002) in monozygotic twins than in dizygotic twins (0.108, P = 0.46), corresponding to a heritability h2 for the fractal dimension of 0.79. In quantitative genetic models, dominant genetic effects explained 54% of the variation and 46% was individually environmentally determined. Conclusions: In young adult twins, the branching pattern of the retinal vessels demonstrated a higher structural similarity in monozygotic than in dizygotic twin pairs. The retinal vascular fractal dimension was mainly determined by genetic factors, which accounted for 54% of the variation. The genetically predetermination of the retinal vasculature may affect the retinal response to potential vascular disease in later life.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Vergmann, Anna Stage","Broe, Rebecca","Kessel, Line","Hougaard, Jesper Leth","Møller, Søren","Kyvik, Kirsten Ohm","Larsen, Michael","Munch, Inger Christine","Grauslund, Jakob"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-042473"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Lund University"],"keyword":["Adult","Cross Sectional Studies","Female","Fractals","Heredity","Humans","Journal Article","Male","Middle Aged","Monozygotic","Quantitative Trait Heritable","Retinal Vessels","Retinal vascular fractal dimension","Surveys and Questionnaires","Twin","Twin study","Twins Dizygotic","Twins Monozygotic","Young Adult"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"heritability of retinal vascular fractals a twin study","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1167/iovs.17-22072","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-042473","identifier":[{"id":"28800646","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85027374014","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-53d6b865-dfd9-459a-a599-6f3bf502298a","sdu-a557a06a-4ab8-4077-82a7-003d77428029"],"keyword":["Adult","Cross-Sectional Studies","Dizogotic","Female","Fractals","Heredity","Humans","Journal Article","Male","Middle Aged","Monozygotic","Quantitative Trait, Heritable","Retinal Vessels","Retinal vascular fractal dimension","Surveys and Questionnaires","Twin","Twin Study","Twins, Dizygotic","Twins, Monozygotic","Young Adult"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-34F939E424F49082B1F99A94341E3EAE"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/185269584/i1552_5783_58_10_3997.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1167/iovs.17-22072","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/1258511