{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: Stroke and mortality risk among heart failure patients previously diagnosed with different manifestations of vascular disease is poorly described. We conducted an observational study to evaluate the stroke and mortality risk among heart failure patients without diagnosed atrial fibrillation and with peripheral artery disease (PAD) or prior myocardial infarction (MI). METHODS: Population-based cohort study of patients diagnosed with incident heart failure during 2000-2012 and without atrial fibrillation, identified by record linkage between nationwide registries in Denmark. Hazard rate ratios of ischemic stroke and all-cause death after 1 year of follow-up were used to compare patients with either: a PAD diagnosis; a prior MI diagnosis; or no vascular disease. RESULTS: 39,357 heart failure patients were included. When compared to heart failure patients with no vascular disease, PAD was associated with a higher 1-year rate of ischemic stroke (adjusted hazard rate ratio [HR]: 1.34, 95% confidence interval [CI]: 1.08-1.65) and all-cause death (adjusted HR: 1.47, 95% CI: 1.35-1.59), whereas prior MI was not (adjusted HR: 1.00, 95% CI: 0.86-1.15 and 0.94, 95% CI: 0.89-1.00, for ischemic stroke and all-cause death, respectively). When comparing patients with PAD to patients with prior MI, PAD was associated with a higher rate of both outcomes. CONCLUSIONS: Among incident heart failure patients without diagnosed atrial fibrillation, a previous diagnosis of PAD was associated with a significantly higher rate of the ischemic stroke and all-cause death compared to patients with no vascular disease or prior MI. Prevention strategies may be particularly relevant among HF patients with PAD.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Melgaard, Line","Gorst-Rasmussen, Anders","Rasmussen, Lars Hvilsted","Lip, Gregory Y H","Larsen, Torben Bjerregaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-115425"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","City Hospital in Birmingham","University of Birmingham"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"vascular disease and risk stratification for ischemic stroke and all cause death in heart failure patients without diagnosed atrial fibrillation a nationwide cohort study","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0152269","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-115425","identifier":[{"id":"27015524","type":"pmid"},{"id":"000372708900048","type":"wos"},{"id":"85020241680","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-e0d8d2e6-e6b5-4594-b5c6-397df50315bf"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-315DDFD4B92AD49ECF3697313FEA996F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0152269","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine, Aalborg Thrombosis Research Unit"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"gb","key":"university of birmingham","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Birmingham","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"gb","key":"city hospital in birmingham","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"City Hospital in Birmingham","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Line","key":"melgaardpau","last":"Melgaard","locid":"88687b9c-5b56-4584-a89a-89fdeca4fd54","name":"Melgaard, Line","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"gorstrasmussenpau","last":"Gorst-Rasmussen","locid":"2aa85786-c0b1-42ec-93d4-eb7a75696409","name":"Gorst-Rasmussen, Anders","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars Hvilsted","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"20cfd847-7f3e-4c77-88c0-32d3432496ed","name":"Rasmussen, Lars Hvilsted","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2 3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gregory Y H","key":"lippau","last":"Lip","locid":"8fa30e84-7381-41b4-8037-afc032238a3d","name":"Lip, Gregory Y H","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Torben Bjerregaard","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"a3c6747f-b9db-488b-8eb9-887d38742880","name":"Larsen, Torben Bjerregaard","orcid":"0000-0002-8485-8674","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["27015524"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1371/journal.pone.0152269","issn":["19326203"],"issue":"3","journal":"PLOS ONE","paperid":"e0152269","publisher":"Public Library of Science","status":"p","title":"PLOS ONE","title_org":"P L o S One","volume":"11"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85020241680"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-e0d8d2e6-e6b5-4594-b5c6-397df50315bf"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Vascular Disease and Risk Stratification for Ischemic Stroke and All-Cause Death in Heart Failure Patients without Diagnosed Atrial Fibrillation : A Nationwide Cohort Study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-115425","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Artiklen handler om samarbejdende praksisforskning i og omkring Grundtvigs Højskoles bandeseminarer. Dette er et mangeårigt samarbejde der involverer mange hundrede deltagere og som har været med til at skabe nye former for inkluderende, demokratisk og kompromisløs kritisk dialog mellem meget forskellige parter omkring, hvordan man bedst kan forstå og intervenere i forhold til tiltagende bandeproblematikker i Danmark. Artiklen analyserer, hvordan et praksisforskningssamarbejde med engagerede aktører omkring bandeseminarerne kan medvirke til at skabe nye overskridende bevægelser, således at deltagere eksempelvis begynder at deltage i en mere åben, ærlig og kompromisløs diskussion af de mange svære dilemmaer og dobbeltheder indenfor bandeintervention. Det analyseres endvidere, hvordan inkluderende grænsefællesskaber omkring bande-seminarerne er med til at involvere deltagere fra nye grænsepositioner og på den baggrund udvikle nye handlemuligheder i arbejdet med at overskride bandekonflikter og bandeinvolvering.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Mørck, Line Lerche"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-159298"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Bande","Bande exit","Bande og kriminalitet","Bandeforebyggelse","Community based intervention","Crime prevention","Dialogisk læring","Ekstremisme","Forebyggelse","Fællesskab","Gang desistance","Kriminalitet","Læring","Mentorordning","Overskridende læring","Radikalisering","Street gangs"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"inkluderende grænsefællesskaber bandeinvolvering og bandekonflikter","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-159298","ids":["au-34650abc-6086-4754-b74f-4ebb9e7e7606"],"keyword":["Bande exit","Bande og kriminalitet","Bandeforebyggelse","Dialogisk læring","Ekstremisme","Forebyggelse","Fællesskab","Kriminalitet","Læring","Mentorordning","Overskridende læring","Radikalisering","bande","community based intervention","crime prevention","gang desistance","street gangs"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-5431A31F70BF2A38CFD0F9269F2E79AF"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, Danish School of Education, Danish School of Education - Research Programme for Diversity, Culture and Change"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Line Lerche","key":"mørckpau","last":"Mørck","locid":"526e8b84-9097-4b78-933c-5d444e2f7aa1","name":"Mørck, Line Lerche","orcid":"0000-0001-9939-7068","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Bjørn","key":"hamrepedh","last":"Hamre","name":"Hamre, Bjørn","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Vibe","key":"larsenpedh","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Vibe","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788771186062"],"pages":"209-226","place":"Frederiksberg","publisher":"Frydenlund Academic","status":"p","title":"Inklusion, udsathed og tværprofessionelt samarbejde"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-34650abc-6086-4754-b74f-4ebb9e7e7606"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Inkluderende grænsefællesskaber, bandeinvolvering og bandekonflikter","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-159298","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
