mperature Prevents the Formation of Visible Aggregates in Acidic Whey Dispersions Over a 6-month Storage Period","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-136667","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"We propose the Logistic Non-negative Matrix Factorization for decomposition of binary data. Binary data are frequently generated in e.g. text analysis, sensory data, market basket data etc. A common method for analysing non-negative data is the Non-negative Matrix Factorization, though this is in theory not appropriate for binary data, and thus we propose a novel Non-negative Matrix Factorization based on the logistic link function. Furthermore we generalize the method to handle missing data. The formulation of the method is compared to a previously proposed method (Tome et al., 2015). We compare the performance of the Logistic Non-negative Matrix Factorization to Least Squares Non-negative Matrix Factorization and Kullback-Leibler (KL) Non-negative Matrix Factorization on sets of binary data: a synthetic dataset, a set of student comments on their professors collected in a binary term-document matrix and a sensory dataset. We find that choosing the number of components is an essential part in the modelling and interpretation, that is still unresolved.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Larsen, Jacob Søgaard","Clemmensen, Line Katrine Harder"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-357376"],"event":{"end":"2015-11-14","place":"Lisbon, pt","start":"2015-11-12","title":"7th International Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Information Retrieval (KDIR 2015)","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Binary data","Non negative matrix factorization"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"non negative matrix factorization for binary data","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-357376","identifier":[{"id":"84960877335","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-b0cec194-d05d-4c4d-995c-834a156be7d3"],"keyword":["Binary Data","Binary Matrix Factorization","Non-negative Matrix Factorization","Text Modelling"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-579086366395D8736F536B5D602C7063"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science, Statistics and Data Analysis"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jacob Søgaard","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"e187fab0-e41e-4d83-95fa-a47ceb325653","name":"Larsen, Jacob Søgaard","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Line Katrine Harder","key":"clemmensenpau","last":"Clemmensen","locid":"4e7ff76e-13f9-4365-83b1-d10bab96517b","name":"Clemmensen, Line Katrine Harder","orcid":"0000-0001-5527-5798","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-b0cec194-d05d-4c4d-995c-834a156be7d3"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Non-negative Matrix Factorization for Binary Data","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-357376","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
