{"abstract":"PURPOSE: We tested the hypothesis that expression of microRNAs (miRNAs) in cancer tissue can predict effectiveness of bevacizumab added to capecitabine and oxaliplatin (CAPEOX) in patients with metastatic colorectal cancer (mCRC). EXPERIMENTAL DESIGN: Patients with mCRC treated with first line CAPEOX and bevacizumab (CAPEOXBEV): screening (n = 212) and validation (n = 121) cohorts, or CAPEOX alone: control cohort (n = 127), were identified retrospectively and archival primary tumor samples were collected. Expression of 754 miRNAs was analyzed in the screening cohort using polymerase chain reaction (PCR) arrays and expression levels were related to time to disease progression (TTP) and overall survival (OS). Significant miRNAs from the screening study were analyzed in all three cohorts using custom PCR arrays. In situ hybridization (ISH) was done for selected miRNAs. RESULTS: In the screening study, 26 miRNAs were significantly correlated with outcome in multivariate analyses. Twenty-two miRNAs were selected for further study. Higher miR-664-3p expression and lower miR-455-5p expression were predictive of improved outcome in the CAPEOXBEV cohorts and showed a significant interaction with bevacizumab effectiveness. The effects were strongest for OS. Both miRNAs showed high expression in stromal cells. Higher expression of miR-196b-5p and miR-592 predicted improved outcome regardless of bevacizumab treatment, with similar effect estimates in all three cohorts. CONCLUSIONS: We have identified potentially predictive miRNAs for bevacizumab effectiveness and additional miRNAs that could be related to chemotherapy effectiveness or prognosis in patients with mCRC. Our findings need further validation in large cohorts, preferably from completed randomized trials.","author_count":20,"contributors":["Boisen, Mogens K","Dehlendorff, Christian","Linnemann, Dorte","Nielsen, Boye S","Larsen, Jim S","Osterlind, Kell","Nielsen, Svend Erik","Tarpgaard, Line S","Qvortrup, Camilla","Pfeiffer, Per","Holländer, Niels H","Keldsen, Nina","Hansen, Torben F","Jensen, Brita B","Høgdall, Estrid V S","Jensen, Benny V","Johansen, Julia S."],"cuid":["S02-088.00-042797"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"tissue micrornas as predictors of outcome in patients with metastatic colorectal cancer treated with first line capecitabine and oxaliplatin with or without bevacizumab","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0109430","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-088.00-042797","identifier":[{"id":"PMC4198118","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"25329796","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84908178940","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-5e5afa2c-344d-44d8-af4d-59eba06ca6a3","sdu-396ae67c-4632-4685-9f46-5138d6fff8db"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-85035067B54D303E0C6372FD000BDA12"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0109430","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Oncology (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Mogens K","key":"boisenmogenskpau","last":"Boisen","name":"Boisen, Mogens K","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Christian","key":"dehlendorffchristianpau","last":"Dehlendorff","name":"Dehlendorff, Christian","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Dorte","key":"linnemanndortepau","last":"Linnemann","name":"Linnemann, Dorte","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Boye S","key":"nielsenboyespau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Boye S","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jim S","key":"larsenjimspau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Jim S","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Kell","key":"osterlindkellpau","last":"Osterlind","locid":"ad886823-757f-4432-9a24-fd2da8012607","name":"Osterlind, Kell","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Svend Erik","key":"nielsensvenderikpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Svend Erik","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Svend E","key":"nielsensvendepau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Svend E","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Line S","key":"tarpgaardlineschmidtpau","last":"Tarpgaard","locid":"189434fc-a387-4c7d-86b9-5e44c8cf4e01","name":"Tarpgaard, Line Schmidt","name_org":"Tarpgaard, Line S","orcid":"0000-0001-8505-2544","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Line S","key":"tarpgaardlinespau","last":"Tarpgaard","name":"Tarpgaard, Line S","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Camilla","key":"qvortrupcamillapau","last":"Qvortrup","locid":"2c49e46c-a864-4f41-8887-9538a277eaec","name":"Qvortrup, Camilla","orcid":"0000-0001-9338-9841","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Per","key":"pfeifferperpau","last":"Pfeiffer","locid":"37da1b83-d32a-4f6c-bde6-ca05372851a5","name":"Pfeiffer, Per","orcid":"0000-0002-2925-0586","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Niels H","key":"holländernielshpau","last":"Holländer","name":"Holländer, Niels H","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Nina","key":"keldsenninapau","last":"Keldsen","name":"Keldsen, Nina","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Torben F","key":"hansentorbenfpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Torben F","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Torben F","key":"hansentorbenfrøstruppau","last":"Hansen","locid":"72d28643-c440-4bbd-ad2b-eef0903a9438","name":"Hansen, Torben Frøstrup","name_org":"Hansen, Torben F","orcid":"0000-0001-7476-671X","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Brita B","key":"jensenbritabpau","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Brita B","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Estrid V S","key":"høgdallestridvspau","last":"Høgdall","name":"Høgdall, Estrid V S","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Benny V","key":"jensenbennyvpau","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Benny V","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Julia S","key":"johansenjuliaspau","last":"Johansen","locid":"b2f1fd05-1a2e-4879-b015-af4dfa479876","name":"Johansen, Julia S.","name_org":"Johansen, Julia S","rank":17,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["25329796"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1371/journal.pone.0109430","issn":["19326203"],"issue":"10","journal":"PLOS ONE","pages":"1-11","paperid":"e109430","status":"p","title":"PLOS ONE","volume":"9"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84908178940"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-5e5afa2c-344d-44d8-af4d-59eba06ca6a3","sdu-396ae67c-4632-4685-9f46-5138d6fff8db"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Tissue MicroRNAs as Predictors of Outcome in Patients with Metastatic Colorectal Cancer Treated with First Line Capecitabine and Oxaliplatin with or without Bevacizumab","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-088.00-042797","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Erythropoietin (Epo) administration improves aerobic exercise capacity and insulin sensitivity in renal patients, and also increases resting energy expenditure (REE). Similar effects are observed in response to endurance training. The aim was to compare the effects of endurance training with erythropoiesis-stimulating agent (ESA) treatment in healthy humans. Thirty-six healthy untrained men were randomized to 10 weeks of either: 1) placebo (n=9), 2) ESA (n=9), 3) endurance training (n=10), or 4) ESA and endurance training (n=8). In a single blinded design, ESA/placebo was injected once weekly. Training consisted of biking for 1h at 65% of wattmax 3 times/week. Measurements performed before and after the intervention: body composition, maximal oxygen uptake, insulin sensitivity, REE, and palmitate turnover. Uncoupling protein 2 (UCP2) mRNA levels were assessed in skeletal muscle. Fat mass decreased after training (p=0.003), whereas ESA induced a small but significant increase in intrahepatic fat (p=0.025). Serum free fatty-acid (FFA) levels and palmitate turnover decreased significantly in response to training, whereas the opposite pattern was found after ESA. REE corrected for lean body mass increased in response to ESA and training and muscle UCP2 mRNA levels increased after ESA (p=0.035). Insulin sensitivity increased only after training (p=0.011). Conclusions: 1) Insulin sensitivity is not improved after ESA treatment despite improved exercise capacity, 2) The calorigenic effects of ESA may be related to increased UCP2 gene expression in skeletal muscle, 3) Training and ESA exert opposite effects on lipolysis under basal conditions, increased FFA levels and liver fat fraction was observed after ESA treatment.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Christensen, Britt","Nellemann, Birgitte","Larsen, Mads Sørensen","Thams, Line","Sieljacks, Peter","Nielsen, Poul Vestergaard","Bibby, Bo Martin","Vissing, Kristian","Stødkilde-Jørgensen, Hans","Pedersen, Steen Bønløkke","Møller, Niels","Nielsen, Søren","Jessen, Niels","Jørgensen, Jens Otto Lunde"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-138545"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"whole body metabolic effects of prolonged endurance training in combination with erythropoietin treatment in humans a randomized placebo controlled study","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84884923159","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-138545","identifier":[{"id":"23921143","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84884923159","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-10030ce8-c72e-4139-ad11-e177ffb8d159"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-3275B64B06B8357B5452CBD8E1182AF4"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Endocrinology and Internal Medicine","Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Medical Research Laboratory","Aarhus University, Health, Department of Public Health, Department of Public Health - Sport Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Britt","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"818501d4-b691-497c-b25b-b792b1040bc0","name":"Christensen, Britt","rank":1,"