{"abstract":"We introduce a novel formalism of label-structured modal transition systems that combines the classical may/must modalities on transitions with structured labels that represent quantitative aspects of the model. On the one hand, the specification formalism is general enough to include models like weighted modal transition systems and allows the system developers to employ more complex label refinement than in the previously studied theories. On the other hand, the formalism maintains the desirable properties required by any specification theory supporting compositional reasoning. In particular, we study modal and thorough refinement, determinization, parallel composition, conjunction, quotient, and logical characterization of label-structured modal transition systems.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Bauer, Sebastian S.","Juhl, Line","Larsen, Kim Guldstrand","Legay, Axel","Srba, Jiri"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-084966"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"extending modal transition systems with structured labels","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1017/S0960129511000697","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-084966","identifier":[{"id":"84863959617","type":"scopus"},{"id":"WOS:000306936800002","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-78463b4b-0ba4-4e7a-8302-617ce19e422e"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-A91252C66BE287050D4DD856B2C972E9"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1017/S0960129511000697","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"de","key":"ludwig maximilians universität münchen","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Distributed Systems and Semantics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sebastian S.","key":"bauerpau","last":"Bauer","name":"Bauer, Sebastian S.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Line","key":"juhlpau","last":"Juhl","locid":"21a2e37c-da4b-4f37-bae6-c417ac9e513b","name":"Juhl, Line","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kim Guldstrand","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"27dbc400-17ea-4672-9343-63093ad486c9","name":"Larsen, Kim Guldstrand","orcid":"0000-0002-5953-3384","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Axel","key":"legaypau","last":"Legay","locid":"8755f01e-c7cb-443a-bac8-1cfd63ba931c","name":"Legay, Axel","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jiri","key":"srbapau","last":"Srba","locid":"80949f98-0516-4ca6-986e-b26fe112b48e","name":"Srba, Jiri","orcid":"0000-0001-5551-6547","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1017/s0960129511000697","issn":["09601295","14698072"],"issn_org":["09601295"],"issue":"4","journal":"Mathematical Structures in Computer Science","pages":"581-617","publisher":"Cambridge University Press","status":"p","title":"Mathematical Structures in Computer Science","volume":"22"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84863959617"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-78463b4b-0ba4-4e7a-8302-617ce19e422e"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Extending Modal Transition Systems with Structured Labels","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-084966","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Multiweighted modal automata provide a specification theory for multiweighted transition systems that have recently attracted interest in the context of energy games. We propose a simple fragment of CTL that is able to express properties about accumulated weights along maximal runs of multiweighted modal automata. Our logic is equipped with a game-based semantics and guarantees both soundness (formula satisfaction is propagated to the modal refinements) as well as completeness (formula non-satisfaction is propagated to at least one of its implementations). We augment our theory with a summary of decidability and complexity results of the generalized model checking problem, asking whether a specification - abstracting the whole set of its implementations - satisfies a given formula.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Bauer, Sebastian S.","Juhl, Line","Larsen, Kim Guldstrand","Srba, Jiri","Legay, Axel"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-093905"],"event":{"acronym":"TASE","end":"2012-07-06","place":"Beijing, cn","start":"2012-07-04","title":"Sixth International Symposium on Theoretical Aspects of Software Engineering","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a logic for accumulated weight reasoning on multiweighted modal automata","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/TASE.2012.9","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-093905","identifier":[{"id":"84866947374","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-97454c39-80e6-4339-bd1f-8cdfb687c045"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-0163571412B65F48BFA3AA4EE8A628FE"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/TASE.2012.9","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"de","key":"ludwig maximilians universität münchen","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Distributed Systems and Semantics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sebastian S.","key":"bauerpau","last":"Bauer","name":"Bauer, Sebastian S.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Line","key":"juhlpau","last":"Juhl","locid":"21a2e37c-da4b-4f37-bae6-c417ac9e513b","name":"Juhl, Line","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"K.G.","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"27dbc400-17ea-4672-9343-63093ad486c9","name":"Larsen, Kim Guldstrand","name_org":"Larsen, K.G.","orcid":"0000-0002-5953-3384","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"J.","key":"srbapau","last":"Srba","locid":"80949f98-0516-4ca6-986e-b26fe112b48e","name":"Srba, Jiri","name_org":"Srba, J.","orcid":"0000-0001-5551-6547","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"A.","key":"legaypau","last":"Legay","locid":"8755f01e-c7cb-443a-bac8-1cfd63ba931c","name":"Legay, Axel","name_org":"Legay, A.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/tase.2012.9","isbn":["9781467323536"],"pages":"77-84","publisher":"IEEE Computer Society Press","status":"p","title":"Proceedings - IEEE 6th International Symposium on Theoretical Aspects of Software Engineering, TASE 2012"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84866947374"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-97454c39-80e6-4339-bd1f-8cdfb687c045"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"A Logic for Accumulated-Weight Reasoning on Multiweighted Modal Automata","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-093905","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Rickettsial diseases are increasingly reported in international travellers. Prospective studies have shown that 2-4 % of travellers returning with fever have a rickettsiosis. We discuss epidemiology, clinical findings, diagnostics, treatment and prevention of rickettsiosis. In conclusion, rickettsiosis should be considered in the returned traveller with fever, especially when malaria, dengue fever and typhoid fever have been excluded. There is a possibility that doxycycline may have a prophylactic effect on rickettsiosis, but this thesis is only imaginary and needs further investigation.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Kibsgaard, Line","Lindberg, Jens","Villumsen, John Steen","Larsen, Carsten Schade"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-257554"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Animals","Anti Bacterial Agents","Bites and Stings","Diagnosis Differential","Doxycycline","Fever","Humans","Polymerase Chain Reaction","Rickettsia","Rickettsia Infections","Ticks","Travel"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"rickettsiose som differentialdiagnostisk overvejelse ved rejserelateret feber","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84864582031","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-257554","identifier":[{"id":"22668647","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84864582031","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-e0973d9b-dd44-49be-80d1-a2f05ac50343"],"keyword":["Animals","Anti-Bacterial Agents","Bites and Stings","Diagnosis, Differential","Doxycycline","Fever","Humans","Polymerase Chain Reaction","Rickettsia","Rickettsia Infections","Ticks","Travel"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-CE9B4796E1FEBA731F04E2DB28BC22F8"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - The Department of Dermatology and Venereology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Line","key":"kibsgaardpau","last":"Kibsgaard","locid":"1d5d342c-8cbc-432e-9ecc-35b9e7019cb4","name":"Kibsgaard, Line","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens","key":"lindbergpau","last":"Lindberg","name":"Lindberg, Jens","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"John Steen","key":"villumsenpau","last":"Villumsen","name":"Villumsen, John Steen","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carsten Schade","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"2435cb82-03bd-498b-909d-1ef0e99443fe","name":"Larsen, Carsten Schade","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["22668647"],"pub":{"issn":["00415782","13994174"],"issn_org":["00415782"],"issue":"22","journal":"Ugeskrift for Læger","pages":"1525-8","publisher":"Almindelige Danske Lægeforening","status":"p","title":"Ugeskrift for Læger","volume":"174"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84864582031"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"s