{"abstract":"Iron oxide nanoparticles have found widespread applications in different areas including cell separation, drug delivery and as contrast agents. Due to water insolubility and stability issues, nanoparticles utilized for biological applications require coatings such as the commonly employed polyethylene glycol (PEG). Despite its frequent use, the influence of PEG coatings on the physicochemical and biological properties of iron nanoparticles has hitherto not been studied in detail. To address this, we studied the effect of 333–20 000 Da PEG coatings that resulted in larger hydrodynamic size, lower surface charge, longer circulation half-life, and lower uptake in macrophage cells when the particles were coated with high molecular weight (Mw) PEG molecules. By use of magnetic resonance imaging, we show coating-dependent in vivo uptake in murine tumors with an optimal coating Mw of 10 000 Da","author_count":12,"contributors":["Larsen, Esben Kjær Unmack","Nielsen, Thomas","Wittenborn, Thomas R.","Rydtoft, Louise Munk","Lokanathan, Arcot R.","Hansen, Line","Østergaard, Leif","Kingshott, Peter","Howard, Ken","Besenbacher, Flemming","Nielsen, Niels Christian","Kjems, Jørgen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-163397"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"accumulation of magnetic iron oxide nanoparticles coated with variably sized polyethylene glycol in murine tumors","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1039/C2NR11554A","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-163397","identifier":[{"id":"84861852448","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-3bc02ec5-4a6f-408d-bd61-49af6c40092f"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-9AB3FCE813CBAC9260C3D19C3F3F8401"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1039/C2NR11554A","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Molecular Biology and Genetics","Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Physics and Astronomy","Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Interdisciplinary Nanoscience Center"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Esben Kjær Unmack","key":"larsenesbenkjærunmackpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"82092ac6-5b78-4893-82dd-bb85986e3deb","name":"Larsen, Esben Kjær Unmack","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas","key":"nielsenthomaspau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"a892a177-3001-4c39-959d-ddfdd25a4f11","name":"Nielsen, Thomas","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas","key":"wittenbornthomasrpau","last":"Wittenborn","locid":"563cd85d-66a7-410d-a66b-fee9daa9fccf","name":"Wittenborn, Thomas R.","name_org":"Wittenborn, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0002-6361-542X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Louise Munk","key":"rydtoftlouisemunkpau","last":"Rydtoft","locid":"603c61d0-3b38-4f40-940e-c827e4711438","name":"Rydtoft, Louise Munk","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Arcot R.","key":"lokanathanarcotrpau","last":"Lokanathan","locid":"56fe202c-b628-4857-93b8-3cc3a66f554b","name":"Lokanathan, Arcot R.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Line","key":"hansenlinepau","last":"Hansen","locid":"729ea402-8050-4923-a2a1-2bfeb5a6fd63","name":"Hansen, Line","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Leif","key":"østergaardleifpau","last":"Østergaard","locid":"af45ec8c-f95a-4937-9e48-ffabe2b8933d","name":"Østergaard, Leif","orcid":"0000-0003-2930-6997","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter","key":"kingshottpeterpau","last":"Kingshott","locid":"05489385-9fe3-4c3e-bbd4-7ffbf51fc0b8","name":"Kingshott, Peter","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kenneth A","key":"howardkenpau","last":"Howard","locid":"8ecf79c2-bb52-4f69-9438-72a69a44a0c9","name":"Howard, Ken","name_org":"Howard, Kenneth A","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Flemming","key":"besenbacherflemmingpau","last":"Besenbacher","locid":"0aa89800-dd75-4f15-a575-c419dda7a69f","name":"Besenbacher, Flemming","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Niels Christian","key":"nielsennielschristianpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"32a7422d-cc2f-4301-87c9-951639ed3662","name":"Nielsen, Niels Christian","orcid":"0000-0003-2978-4366","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jørgen","key":"kjemsjørgenpau","last":"Kjems","locid":"f5915d75-aca3-437a-9a9d-f4fdfef7accd","name":"Kjems, Jørgen","orcid":"0000-0003-4128-9317","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1039/c2nr11554a","issn":["20403364","20403372"],"issn_org":["20403364"],"issue":"7","journal":"Nanoscale","pages":"2352-2361","publisher":"Royal Society of Chemistry","status":"p","title":"Nanoscale","volume":"4"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84861852448"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-3bc02ec5-4a6f-408d-bd61-49af6c40092f"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Accumulation of magnetic iron oxide nanoparticles coated with variably sized polyethylene glycol in murine tumors","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-163397","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"This paper analyses the variability of load, wind power production and their combination in the Nordic countries during 2009-11, based on real data measured from large-scale wind power. The results show that wind and load variations are not correlated between the countries, which is beneficial from the viewpoint of wind integration. The smoothing effect is shown as reduction of variability from a single country to Nordic wide wind power. The impact of wind power on the variability that the system sees is depicted by analysing the variability of net load with different wind power penetration levels. The timing of ramps, and occurrence of high wind and low load are studied. With current wind penetration, low production levels (2-5 % of installed wind power) can occur in a single country during peak loads, but in the Nordic region the production during peak loads does not fall to so low levels (minimum 14 % during 10 highest peaks).","author_count":6,"contributors":["Holttinen, Hannele","Rissanen, Simo","Giebel, Gregor","Larsén, Xiaoli Guo","Løvholm, Anne Line","Berge, Erik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-333253"],"event":{"end":"2012-11-15","place":"Lisbon, pt","start":"2012-11-13","title":"11th International Workshop on Large-Scale Integration of Wind Power into Power Systems as well as on Transmission Networks for Offshore Wind Power Plants","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Finland","Norway"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Kjeller Vindteknikk AS","VTT Technical Research Centre of Finland Ltd."],"keyword":["Power system operations","Reserve allocation","Wind integration","Wind power"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"variability and smoothing effect of wind power production compared to load variability in the nordic countries","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/57657176/Variability_and_smoothing_effect.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-333253","ids":["dtu-60537097-aa99-44fd-a4a6-c4cba5d54b8d"],"keyword":["Power system operations","Reserve allocation","Wind integration","Wind power"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-DC1239BA2D99B6CF13730D36643296BE"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/57657176/Variability_and_smoothing_effect.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"fi","key":"vtt technical research centre of finland ltd","loc":["Finland","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VTT Technical Research Centre of Finland Ltd.","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Wind Energy","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Wind Energy, Wind Energy Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"no","key":"kjeller vindteknikk as","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Kjeller Vindteknikk AS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hannele","key":"holttinenpau","last":"Holttinen","name":"Holttinen, Hannele","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Simo","key":"rissanenpau","last":"Rissanen","name":"Rissanen, Simo","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Gregor","key":"giebelpau","last":"Giebel","locid":