{"abstract":"We propose weighted modal transition systems, an extension to the well-studied specification formalism of modal transition systems that allows to express both required and optional behaviours of their intended implementations. In our extension we decorate each transition with a weight interval that indicates the range of concrete weight values available to the potential implementations. In this way resource constraints can be modelled using the modal approach. We focus on two problems. First, we study the question of existence/finding the largest common refinement for a number of finite deterministic specifications and we show PSPACE-completeness of this problem. By constructing the most general common refinement, we allow for a stepwise and iterative construction of a common implementation. Second, we study a logical characterisation of the formalism and show that a formula in a natural weight extension of the logic CTL is satisfied by a given modal specification if and only if it is satisfied by all its refinements. The weight extension is general enough to express different sorts of properties that we want our weights to satisfy.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Juhl, Line","Larsen, Kim Guldstrand","Srba, Jiri"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-054412"],"event":{"acronym":"NWPT","end":"2009-10-16","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2009-10-14","title":"Nordic Workshop on Programming Theory, NWPT'09","year":"2009"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"modal transition systems with weight intervals","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jlap.2012.03.008","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-054412","identifier":[{"id":"84860382179","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000304490400004","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-0efb3e6e-5027-47dd-9c45-369fe03aabbe"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-6FAF561016E5BF76EEDC4F75F1A702B1"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jlap.2012.03.008","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Line","key":"juhlpau","last":"Juhl","locid":"21a2e37c-da4b-4f37-bae6-c417ac9e513b","name":"Juhl, Line","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kim Guldstrand","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"27dbc400-17ea-4672-9343-63093ad486c9","name":"Larsen, Kim Guldstrand","orcid":"0000-0002-5953-3384","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jiri","key":"srbapau","last":"Srba","locid":"80949f98-0516-4ca6-986e-b26fe112b48e","name":"Srba, Jiri","orcid":"0000-0001-5551-6547","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.jlap.2012.03.008","issn":["23522208","23522216"],"issn_org":["23522208"],"issue":"4","journal":"Journal of Logic and Algebraic Programming","pages":"408-421","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Journal of Logic and Algebraic Programming","volume":"81"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84860382179"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-0efb3e6e-5027-47dd-9c45-369fe03aabbe"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Modal Transition Systems with Weight Intervals","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-054412","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Both systemic inflammation and impaired cerebral autoregulation (CA) have been associated with brain injury in preterm infants. We hypothesized that impaired CA represents a hemodynamic link between inflammation and brain injury.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Hahn, Gitte Holst","Maroun, Lisa Leth","Larsen, Nanna","Hougaard, David M","Sorensen, Line C","Lou, Hans Olav Christensen","Greisen, Gorm"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-013627"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Biological Markers","Blood Pressure","Cerebrum","Female","Hemodynamics","Homeostasis","Humans","Hypotension","Infant Newborn","Inflammation","Interleukin 6","Male","Premature Birth","Retrospective Studies"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-SSI"],"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-SSI","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"cerebral autoregulation in the first day after preterm birth no evidence of association with systemic inflammation","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/pr.2011.46","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-013627","identifier":[{"id":"84856877367","type":"scopus"},{"id":"22278187","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-0e45e49c-ed8c-4d3d-82fb-f12f5f18478e","ku-1b94fb14-4ae8-4254-b8ba-071aed950eb7"],"keyword":["Biological Markers","Blood Pressure","Cerebrum","Female","Hemodynamics","Homeostasis","Humans","Hypotension","Infant, Newborn","Inflammation","Interleukin-6","Male","Premature Birth","Retrospective Studies"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-F95155A232A86E5726C86044A35A7E75"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","ty