ngs","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-372045","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"In Paamiut in Kalaallit Nunaat (Greenland) a community mobilisation programme has been launched as a response to a history of violence, suicides, drug abuse, and child neglect. The overall goal of the programme is to strengthen community resilience, psychosocial well-being and revitalisation of the culture through promotion of locally formulated values and resources, shared activities, mobilisation of social networks, job opportunities and options for entrepreneurship. One of the main goals is to prevent child neglect through a specific programme for young mothers. The chapter describes and analyses the development of concepts, interaction, and social action in the group pf young mothers.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Berliner, Peter","Larsen, Line Natascha","de Casas Soberón, María Elena"],"cuid":["S02-082.00-029315"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corpau":["Peter Berliner, Line Natascha Larsen, Elena de Casas Soberón"],"keyword":["Community resilience","Fællesskab","Inuit","Læring","Resilience","Resiliens"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum","soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a social action learning approach to community resilience our sharing of thoughts and feelings our respect and trust should be passed on to the next generation","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S02-082.00-029315","ids":["au-e5c0d115-d060-4d74-9b86-d5f19e2fae48","ku-ed7d74ea-15dc-4301-9ccf-b47c8faa6322"],"keyword":["Fællesskab","Inuit","Læring","Resilience","Resiliens","Young mother","community resilience"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities","Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-2-4E12E652